  "description": "Flows Inspector reads all cloud flows of the connected Dataverse environment and reports on them: triggers, actions, connectors and connection references, owners and their license status, run and failure statistics, automatic health findings, and an interactive map of flows that trigger each other in a loop. Filter by name, solution, publisher, owner, status, Dataverse table, SharePoint site, connection and more; export everything to Excel. The UI is fully available in Hebrew (right-to-left) and English. Read-only: it never changes a flow.",
